==Trivia==
[[File:MoltresexGeneticApex274 artwork.png|thumb|Standalone illustration]]
The special illustration rare card features {{p|Moltres}} flying above [[Mt. Ember]] in the [[Sevii Islands]], where it can be found in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}. {{p|Machop}} and {{p|Machoke}}, which can be found in the same location in the games, also appear in the illustration.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Moltres}}.
*'''Heat Blast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Latias Half Deck|Latias|4}} from the {{TCG|EX Trainer Kit}}.

